# Allowlist: only the package, the serving requirements and the verified checkpoints
# enter the build context. data/ (images, manifests, phone photos), .env, .venv, .git,
# evaluation outputs and training history all stay out.
*
!vg/
!vg/**
!requirements-api.txt
!runs/baseline/selection.json
!runs/baseline/cnn.pt
!runs/baseline/frozen.pt
!runs/baseline/finetuned.pt

**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
